### Blogicode.API — yerel test (VS / Rider HTTP Client)
@base = http://localhost:5299/api

### Sağlık
GET {{base}}/health

### Kayıt
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### Giriş
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### Yazılar
GET {{base}}/posts?sort=recent

### Chatbot
POST {{base}}/chatbot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Merhaba",
  "history": []
}
